  "bodyHash": "9e93dc58df7cd25f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">本项目已停止维护，期待在我的新项目里与你重逢</span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">若有人对贡献代码感兴趣，源代码已托管于 GitHub<br>欢迎来到 Aviator Dreams</strong></span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a533c351-0cb6-4108-b861-37c76661ef62.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"414\" height=\"380\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><strong>Aviator Dreams 是什么：简单来说，它是为名为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Aircraft</a> 的模组制作的扩展包。该模组为游戏添加了从双翼机到大型飞艇等各种飞行器，而 Aviator Dreams 将为该模组增加更多飞机。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\"><strong>主题：Aviator Dreams 旨在为游戏添加现实中的飞机，我们不制作奇幻风格的内容，因为那并非我们的强项。目前主题为“先锋”（Pioneer），主要包含早期的螺旋桨飞机。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>目前已包含的飞机：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-1</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/248/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"575\" height=\"306\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Douglas DC-2</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/247/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"580\" height=\"307\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Douglas C-47</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/246/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"583\" height=\"305\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -DeHavilland Comet 1</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/241/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"587\" height=\"294\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Fokker F.VIIA</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/245/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"587\" height=\"308\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Fokker F.VIIB/3M</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/244/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"592\" height=\"278\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Lockheed L-1049G Super Constellation</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/249/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"598\" height=\"316\"></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -Totoya Stout K100（非飞机）</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1014/243/2024-11-14_21.png\" alt=\"screenshot image\" width=\"603\" height=\"313\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>未来计划：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-3</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Douglas DC-4</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Hawker Siddley Trident 3B</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-DeHavilland DH.16</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>-Boeing 737-200</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 以及更多待定机型（视后续规划而定）</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>致谢：Nax（模型与贴图制作）。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Hashim（Fokker F7 贴图制作）<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Bomb787（Forge 清理与注册表修复）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:80px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 感谢 Conczin 在搭建项目和问题排查方面提供的帮助。<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 同时感谢 Immersive Aircraft 和 Man of Many Planes 的作者，为扩展包开发提供了宝贵的源代码参考。</strong></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
